Drop image-based template assets here as flat files, e.g.
assets/templates/<template_id>_background.png (+ optional
assets/templates/<template_id>_continuation.png).

This folder is declared in pubspec.yaml as a wildcard ("assets/templates/"),
but Flutter's folder-wildcard asset declaration only picks up files placed
directly inside the folder -- NOT nested subfolders -- so keep file names
flat (no assets/templates/<id>/background.png subfolders) to avoid needing
a pubspec.yaml edit for every new template.
